                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْتَقَمْتُ مِنْهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>I took,</i> or <i>executed, vengeance
on him,</i> or <i>inflicted penal retribution on him, for
that which he had done:</i> (JK:) or <i>I punished
him;</i> (S, Msb, K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْهُ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَقَمْتُ</span></b> , (Msb,
K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَيهِ</span>, (TA,) aor. 
    
